   "notes": "Lion Yard single-storey shop unit on the south side of St Tibbs Row (east end, p0 = east corner). Orange-buff brick with a tall brick stallriser and a wide black-framed display window under a deep slate-roof overhang (hipped at the corner), white 'Terminal D' sign (2017); open corner porch with a white column (pilaster at ~6.4) and recessed glazed entrance at the west end. Slate roof with box dormers above (modelled as one dormer). Widths estimated from oblique views."
